Ravana vows to kill Rama and Lakshmana --- Ravana calls Rama a tree with monkey branches --- Ravana burns all monkeys with Tamasa weapon --- Rama stands firm with Lakshmana --- Lakshmana shoots and Ravana parries arrow for arrow --- Ravana rains arrows and Rama cuts them down --- Archers circle exchanging arrow floods --- Ravana plants arrows in Rama forehead harmlessly --- Rama arrows break harmless on Ravana armor --- Ravana hurls beast-faced serpent arrows, Rama dissolves them with fire